  {
    "text": "If they come, I run out. If they don't,",
    "start": 1154.52,
    "duration": 3.28
  },
  {
    "text": "I get the objective.",
    "start": 1156.48,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": ">> From the rubble, true order will be",
    "start": 1157.8,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "born.",
    "start": 1159.96,
    "duration": 2.4
  },
  {
    "text": ">> Now, you see?",
    "start": 1175.12,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Now we get middle wave and look I'm not",
    "start": 1176.96,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "being No, no, no, no, no, no, no.",
    "start": 1178.76,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm sure enemy team is going to come",
    "start": 1182.48,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "into here.",
    "start": 1183.92,
    "duration": 2.56
  },
  {
    "text": "I think we probably do it.",
    "start": 1188.72,
    "duration": 2.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Got him, boys.",
    "start": 1220.2,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "But again, the whole point I actually",
    "start": 1221.52,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "didn't really want to do the Baron is",
    "start": 1224.36,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "because I knew the enemy team was going",
    "start": 1226.44,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "to face check us and come in here.",
    "start": 1228.6,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Which is why I would have much rather",
    "start": 1231.36,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "just kill them when they come in",
    "start": 1233.0,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "than do it.",
    "start": 1235.2,
    "duration": 2.56
  },
  {
    "text": "But now of course I got [ __ ] tons of",
    "start": 1240.6,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "gold. I got a quadra kill.",
    "start": 1242.08,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "It's time for me to base and I'm still",
    "start": 1244.36,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "playing",
    "start": 1246.12,
    "duration": 3.6
  },
  {
    "text": "for the Baron. And I'm going to go",
    "start": 1248.64,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Mejai's.",
    "start": 1249.72,
    "duration": 2.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Now if we can fight on the bottom lane",
    "start": 1256.76,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "it would be good.",
    "start": 1258.08,
    "duration": 2.64
  },
  {
    "text": ">> Time to crack the upper crust.",
    "start": 1262.68,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": ">> I have my guys, so",
    "start": 1274.36,
    "duration": 3.08
  },
  {
    "text": ">> [screaming]",
    "start": 1278.574,
    "duration": 2.02
  },
  {
    "text": ">> I'm really fast, basically.",
    "start": 1283.32,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Now, the next objective is still going",
    "start": 1285.88,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "to be the Baron. I'm not going to chase",
    "start": 1287.92,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "the bike. Chasing bikes like",
    "start": 1289.24,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "not going to be playable.",
    "start": 1291.76,
    "duration": 3.08
  },
  {
    "text": "I'll just take the camps here.",
    "start": 1296.16,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Play for Baron control.",
    "start": 1299.12,
    "duration": 3.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Now, because Nocturne is dead,",
    "start": 1305.24,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "ooh, maybe I can catch someone in",
    "start": 1310.28,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "rotation here.",
    "start": 1311.84,
    "duration": 2.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh, he just flipped it.",
    "start": 1325.44,
    "duration": 3.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Bro, he just [ __ ] flipped it.",
    "start": 1336.76,
    "duration": 3.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Anyway, I could have played it a bit",
    "start": 1339.96,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "better. No, my Mejai stacks.",
    "start": 1341.32,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "All good, though.",
    "start": 1345.12,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Well, I might have lost my Mejais.",
    "start": 1347.76,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "It doesn't matter. I'll get it back.",
    "start": 1350.68,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "The next item I just got Rabadon.",
    "start": 1354.72,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Do you see here how the Drake is",
    "start": 1358.68,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "spawning?",
    "start": 1360.12,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "In 1 minute, though.",
    "start": 1361.92,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "And I'm dead at the moment.",
    "start": 1364.0,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "I just ping them back",
    "start": 1369.36,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "because I need them to survive here.",
    "start": 1371.2,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "And if they survive here,",
    "start": 1374.16,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "we can then play for the Drake.",
    "start": 1376.36,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": ">> Even death cannot chain me.",
    "start": 1381.16,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": ">> So now my lanes are surviving here. I",
    "start": 1385.24,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "will clear my top side camps into the",
    "start": 1387.6,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "drake.",
    "start": 1389.76,
    "duration": 2.56
  },
  {
    "text": "See my Yone, I just So Yasuo, I just",
    "start": 1394.72,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "came back.",
    "start": 1396.8,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, enemy team has numbers here.",
    "start": 1398.48,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "I do look before.",
    "start": 1400.76,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "How it look like?",
    "start": 1403.48,
    "duration": 2.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Um but it seems like enemy team cannot",
    "start": 1416.68,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "kill my Yasuo.",
    "start": 1418.8,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And I got cooked.",
    "start": 1420.76,
    "duration": 2.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Now we get the drake.",
    "start": 1430.36,
    "duration": 3.44
  },
  {
    "text": "And after we get the drake, how do you",
    "start": 1434.04,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "want to snowball the game? I think I",
    "start": 1436.68,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "don't do the thing, okay? After we take",
    "start": 1437.88,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "drake, what's the next objective?",
    "start": 1439.68,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "What is it?",
    "start": 1456.92,
    "duration": 2.52
  },
  {
    "text": "It is",
    "start": 1462.72,
    "duration": 2.6
  },
  {
    "text": "open tower.",
    "start": 1467.36,
    "duration": 2.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Now,",
    "start": 1470.8,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "how do you play for the top lane tower?",
    "start": 1471.92,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "Cuz it's very great and all that I know",
    "start": 1474.68,
    "duration": 2.4
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm going to play for top lane tower,",
    "start": 1476.08,
    "duration": 2.16
  },
  {
    "text": "but",
    "start": 1477.08,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "I need my Ashe to back off from mid lane",
    "start": 1478.24,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and go top lane. But now that it's a",
    "start": 1481.16,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "fast",
    "start": 1482.64,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "energy dual play.",
    "start": 1484.8,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, the head is in the first half. For",
    "start": 1486.28,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "the moment I said,",
    "start": 1488.36,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm going to look in and do the three",
    "start": 1490.48,
    "duration": 3.6
  },
  {
    "text": "things, which is make a plan,",
    "start": 1492.28,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "communicate to my lanes to not int,",
    "start": 1494.08,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "and then the last one which is count",
    "start": 1496.32,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "numbers.",
    "start": 1498.76,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We get the bread.",
    "start": 1501.12,
    "duration": 2.64
  }
]